// A SevenZipReader's ReadAt takes an entry's index, and panics where it's called with one
// out of range. The 7z is compress_archives/partial.7z.
Import std.core
Import std.compress

Local partial: UInt8[] = [
    0x37, 0x7a, 0xbc, 0xaf, 0x27, 0x1c, 0x00, 0x04, 0xfa, 0x9f, 0xa0, 0x1c, 0x0b, 0x00,
    0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x64, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00,
    0x2b, 0x62, 0xef, 0x43, 0x66, 0x69, 0x72, 0x73, 0x74, 0x20, 0x66, 0x69, 0x6c, 0x65,
    0x0a, 0x01, 0x04, 0x06, 0x00, 0x01, 0x09, 0x0b, 0x00, 0x07, 0x0b, 0x01, 0x00, 0x01,
    0x01, 0x00, 0x0c, 0x0b, 0x0a, 0x01, 0xdf, 0x30, 0xdb, 0xf4, 0x00, 0x08, 0x0d, 0x01,
    0x09, 0x00, 0x00, 0x05, 0x02, 0x0e, 0x01, 0x40, 0x0f, 0x01, 0x80, 0x11, 0x31, 0x00,
    0x70, 0x00, 0x61, 0x00, 0x72, 0x00, 0x74, 0x00, 0x69, 0x00, 0x61, 0x00, 0x6c, 0x00,
    0x2f, 0x00, 0x6f, 0x00, 0x6e, 0x00, 0x65, 0x00, 0x2e, 0x00, 0x74, 0x00, 0x78, 0x00,
    0x74, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x70, 0x00, 0x61, 0x00, 0x72, 0x00, 0x74, 0x00, 0x69, 0x00,
    0x61, 0x00, 0x6c, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00, 0x15, 0x07, 0x00, 0x40, 0x00, 0x10, 0x00, 0x00,
    0x00, 0x00, 0x00
]
Local reader = Try SevenZip.Read(partial)
Print(reader.Count)
Try reader.ReadAt(2)
